This gives you mass conservation diagnostics.

B. Add spectral hooks for velocity-field analysis

You can compute a basic energy spectrum:

u_hat = np.fft.rfftn(u_field[...,0])
E_k = np.abs(u_hat)**2

Then log:

"energy_spectrum_sum": float(np.sum(E_k))

This is the first step toward Kolmogorov-style turbulence analysis.

C. Add a rolling stability certificate

